WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:02.350
- Alright so tell me
about the music video.

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.710
Are those real cockroaches?

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:04.770
'Cause I'm from Texas.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:05.650
I don't do cockroaches,

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:06.569
I hate cockroaches.

00:00:06.569 --> 00:00:09.090
(audience yelling)

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:10.189
Tell me those aren't real.

00:00:10.189 --> 00:00:11.299
- What?

00:00:11.299 --> 00:00:12.132
What?

00:00:12.132 --> 00:00:12.965
- Those are 100%.

00:00:12.965 --> 00:00:13.798
(Kelly groans)

00:00:13.798 --> 00:00:14.631
- [Kaley] What?

00:00:14.631 --> 00:00:15.464
Why?

00:00:15.464 --> 00:00:16.297
Okay look, look, look first.

00:00:16.297 --> 00:00:17.130
- [Kelly] Oh my god.

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:18.480
- Okay so, one this was not my idea.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.360
It was my brother Cole Bennett.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:21.660
- Did one go in your mouth?

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:22.493
- No it didn't,

00:00:22.493 --> 00:00:23.326
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:00:23.326 --> 00:00:26.065
- But it went elsewhere that
I don't want to say on TV.

00:00:26.065 --> 00:00:26.898
(audience laughing)

00:00:26.898 --> 00:00:27.830
(Kelly and Kaley scream)

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:28.663
- Yeah it was crazy.

00:00:28.663 --> 00:00:32.470
- I feel violated just hearing it, okay.

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:33.430
- Alright, so...

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:34.502
- Does someone hate you?

00:00:34.502 --> 00:00:35.472
(laughter)

00:00:35.472 --> 00:00:36.305
- No!

00:00:36.305 --> 00:00:37.138
- [Kelly] Why would they make you do this?

00:00:37.138 --> 00:00:38.880
- This is actually my
homie who shot this video.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:40.010
Shout out Cole Bennett.

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:41.920
So, he sent the treatment

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:44.240
and it had the roaches on the treatment,

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:45.900
but I'm just assumin' it's CGI,

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.337
so by the time we get there and he's like,

00:00:48.337 --> 00:00:49.600
"Yo you gotta put these roaches on you."

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:51.257
I'm like, "Absolutely not.

00:00:51.257 --> 00:00:52.199
"I'm not doin' this."

00:00:52.199 --> 00:00:53.032
- You're insane.

00:00:53.032 --> 00:00:54.790
- Yeah but he knows I'm always like,

00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:56.650
you know how somebody hits
you with your own sayings?

00:00:56.650 --> 00:00:58.350
I'm always like, "Mind over matter"

00:00:58.350 --> 00:00:59.880
you know, "Anything for the art."

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:01.678
So he's like, "Bro what
happened to mind over matter?"

00:01:01.678 --> 00:01:02.511
(laughter)

00:01:02.511 --> 00:01:03.540
"It's all for the art."

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:05.579
And I'm like, "Oh man!"

00:01:05.579 --> 00:01:06.412
(laughter)

00:01:06.412 --> 00:01:07.408
(applause)

00:01:07.408 --> 00:01:08.241
- That's awesome.

00:01:08.241 --> 00:01:09.320
- The crazy thing,

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:12.500
the song is about like three
minutes and 30 seconds,

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:15.770
and I had to rap that
with the roaches on me

00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:17.120
like five different times.

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:17.953
- Nope.

00:01:17.953 --> 00:01:19.686
- That's like 15 minutes worth of roaches.

00:01:19.686 --> 00:01:20.863
- No.

00:01:20.863 --> 00:01:23.875
You know what, I would
have gone back to serving.

00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:25.046
- For real.

00:01:25.046 --> 00:01:25.879
- Would have done it.

00:01:25.879 --> 00:01:26.790
- Alright man I had

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:28.370
roaches in the house sometimes growing up

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:29.430
just to come back-
- Me too!

00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:30.990
- Then I had to do it
and put them all over me.

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:31.823
- I know!

00:01:31.823 --> 00:01:32.656
I grew up with that too.

00:01:32.656 --> 00:01:33.580
Reach into the popcorn bag

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:35.340
and a damn roach is sittin' there.

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:36.173
- Nah it wasn't-

00:01:36.173 --> 00:01:38.110
- Yeah I didn't grow up in the bricks.

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:40.150
I grew up in the sticks so yeah.

00:01:40.150 --> 00:01:40.983
It was not good.

00:01:40.983 --> 00:01:42.370
Are you manifestin' some Grammys?

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:43.203
- Oh absolutely.

00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:44.036
- [Kelly] You should

00:01:44.036 --> 00:01:44.874
- They're on their way, absolutely.

00:01:44.874 --> 00:01:45.707
- You deserve it man.

00:01:45.707 --> 00:01:47.107
It's good what you're doing.

